  "notes": "FORMS:\n{採|さい} (pick, adopt) + {決|けつ} (decide) → deciding by picking/voting\n{採決|さいけつ}する (to take a vote, to put to a vote)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {採決|さいけつ}を{取|と}る (to take a vote)\n- {採決|さいけつ}に{付|ふ}す (to put to a vote)\n- {強行|きょうこう}{採決|さいけつ} (railroading a vote through)\n\nOUTCOMES:\n- {可決|かけつ} (passage, approval)\n- {否決|ひけつ} (rejection)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {投票|とうひょう} (ballot, general voting)\n- {決議|けつぎ} (resolution)",
